td.DHashMap.Internal.AssocList.{v, u} α fun x => β","unsafe":false,"value":137,"source":{"code":"/-- Internal implementation detail of the hash map -/\n@[specialize]\ndef modify [BEq α] {β : Type v} (a : α) (f : β → β) :\n    AssocList α (fun _ => β) → AssocList α (fun _ => β)\n  | nil => nil\n  | cons k v l =>\n    if k == a then\n      cons a (f v) l\n    else\n      cons k v (modify a f l)","start":229,"end":238},"axioms":[]}